483
00:47:31,886 --> 00:47:44,320
如果我们把它们整合进一个被称为 Google Earth AI 的模型系列，并在其上方建立一个智能体层，
也就是 AI 智能体层，这样你就可以询问关于这个星球的任何问题。
What if we bring them all together into a family of model that we call Google Earth AI, and we actually have an agentic layer,
an AI agentic layer on top of that, so you can actually ask any question about the planet.

484
00:47:45,326 --> 00:47:52,720
例如，在危机韧性的背景下，你不仅可以问洪水或风暴会袭击哪里，还可以问哪些社区最脆弱？
For example, in the context of crisis resilience, you can ask not only a question, where is the flood or storm going to hit,
